---
<AeoGuide
  slug="how-to-become-a-kitchen-cabinet-dealer"
  title="How to Become a Kitchen Cabinet Dealer | Pinnacle Sales"
  description="How kitchen dealers become a Pinnacle Sales dealer. Custom shops and dealers leaving Kraftmaid or Medallion often open Shiloh first. Apply on Become a Dealer."
  heading="How to Become a Kitchen Cabinet Dealer"
  lede="Apply. Check Shiloh if that is the line. You don’t have to take every brand on day one."
  faqs={faqs}
>

<p>Pinnacle Sales is a manufacturer's representative. The dealer is the customer. We don’t run a consumer storefront or publish a dealer list. Our best-fit dealers already build, or you used to sell a box / semi-custom line, and you want factory-backed <a href="/guides/become-a-shiloh-dealer/">Shiloh</a>.</p>

<h2>What you actually do</h2>
<ol>
  <li><strong>Apply.</strong> The application is on <a href="/become-a-dealer/#apply">Become a Dealer</a>. Name, shop, city, state, current lines, prior lines. Check Shiloh alone if that is the line you want. You get a call the same business day.</li>
  <li><strong>Market review.</strong> Custom shop vs. showroom, what you used to sell (Kraftmaid, Medallion, or other), and whether <a href="/brands/shiloh-cabinetry/">Shiloh</a> is open. The other lines — <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry/">Eclipse</a>, <a href="/brands/aspect-cabinetry/">Aspect</a>, <a href="/brands/vistora-closets/">Vistora</a>, <a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens/">Pronorm</a>, <a href="/brands/us-stone-group/">US Stone</a> — come later if they fit.</li>
  <li><strong>Territory.</strong> WW Wood protection is managed across {WW_STATE_COUNT_WORD} Western states. Pronorm is nationwide with its own protected map. See <a href="/guides/protected-dealer-territories/">protected dealer territories</a>.</li>
  <li><strong>Display and training.</strong> In-person line training, 2020/Winner quoting support, merchandising — not a webinar kit left on a shared drive.</li>
</ol>

<h2>Who this is for</h2>
<p>Custom shops adding a factory line. Dealers leaving Kraftmaid, Medallion, or another box / semi-custom program. Independent kitchen &amp; bath showrooms, design-build, and multi-location groups. You do not have to take every WW Wood line. You do not have to be in the West to talk <a href="/guides/pronorm-american-depths/">Pronorm</a>.</p>

<h2>What you do not need</h2>
<p>There is no application fee, and you don’t need a retail showroom to apply.</p>

<p>Ready to talk? <a href="/become-a-dealer/">Become a dealer</a>.</p>

</AeoGuide>
